         "source": [
            "## Can multi-listing (“professional”) hosts be distinguished from single-listing hosts, and what operating differences show up in the data?"
         ]
      },
      {
         "cell_type": "markdown",
         "id": "4e38b03f-0683-4c4a-9454-469b39c62aa9",
         "metadata": {
